    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6522ef03ff0e5239ada1540a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员……！\n训练员──！！呜呜呜呜！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bff8ea273b52990b7b978eab76c74e70ffbdcbc58c4a4caefbad4da4e075b64",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027314.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:448d70359387fa56f4f04a32",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的眼神看起来已彻底是目白赖恩的俘虏了。\n目白赖恩成为了一位\n连巨星都为之着迷的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3e6da78d0113aa5c4d385dfb9e90985f538ef37432cf80d025268b4bc336925",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027314.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0c8db2f5aa70f1dce34280a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就这样“有马纪念”迎来了感动的尾声。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37456b8d4556a5294279b7d1ce547eb04c48f5e39bdc571353cd72f3f8c7c5dc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027314.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c809fee1b7e83f750c39f68",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我抱紧目白赖恩。\n她柔韧的身体还在发烫……\n而且像个孩子似地颤抖着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80321a078d43fabc59c69d23a9c27fe146ac01368c51458c303a0b9021fb8002",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027314.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd9f49d409f58d2eacff7093",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小栗帽",
      "source_fingerprint": "11eb326551def639a05cc8c2fabf151803cd99057ccfbaa0c6ba89756bb8c765",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
