    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a00cf04810a959c8e466bc94",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白赖恩",
      "source_fingerprint": "27f6e72e0c5efa49958dfacdc8da250e2490660afaa33a92ed97b52f06851b85",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027314.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:910362458be5e9958fc25aa7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我很努力哦────！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "879b8dda9b6fe67a6c6d063a00fe5b5d870395e1ea45673ff1044bc7d6bdd666",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027314.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b4ef0c9a1f2894fbc76ba94",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白赖恩以符合她风格的咆哮，\n展开了优胜宣告。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6655a218843f3999f3bcdbd39a2efab1757b7020c20a441733769a5b103b3bf4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027314.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58ab0e93c9caba331687666e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有马纪念结束后・比努力更珍贵的事物",
      "source_fingerprint": "a768cf586a2ee37d9fffa084068b608fd5bad849a4de8cec4e4c5fc81998a3b8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027314.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bc38720208b3352f6975bfa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我和全心锻炼的赛马娘目白赖恩，\n一同投入了闪耀系列赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f8fdce6fe33596c9c493924665fef2357034fa39aa1cc4a9b5e1c0cc8894764",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:931c41c899f0b132533c35f3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "实力在目白家当中也算屈指可数的目白麦昆，\n让目白赖恩感到十分羡慕\n并强烈希望自己能够战胜她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ba78eeacd5508e27e69d6a04575565dd7d589fbc97fcd020fe77da196fd6333",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e264d9124521700e8ee9baa7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "接下来，\n我将和这样的她一起挑战闪耀系列赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "86ab1d093324d8252d01ad6e8f451eb73ca6973f1fbdba6fc13f25a24ac50b8d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fded73cfeef49f5eee019cd4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白赖恩登场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "042632038a0c918c4d41ac82f2bb2468cd38a66c0bc68025005fc58502380399",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f612256f3230ab233bc34c5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白赖恩一听说目白麦昆最近状况不佳，\n就慌慌张张地跑去找她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "273b14eb57cb73354a94ae1fd3966f309e5e4a3b814cfcfd0942a170bf9108f0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0874c5140ee06b475df01eb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而目白麦昆无视目白赖恩的担心，\n不仅宣称自己状况绝佳，还提议进行模拟赛，\n借此证明自己所言不假。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2f536fa934b0b002d9c0018a65324edd331fb371760fa0c3030015f9f1718a0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1f46dd8afb284db65abfa98",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白赖恩接受她的挑战，\n并见识到她在长距离方面无以伦比的资质。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe224220aaee8f56d5fe1fb48ff36fbe3933e965300de2424a825d788a14311c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40be207385ef2e6fd3b31149",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "紧接在经典赛之后的是“天皇赏（春）”。\n目白赖恩看见目白麦昆正为了\n这场比赛提升实力而开始感到焦急。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ce02c55371d8ac9cae93c3a4f580496c96393d25ffed9b2bb504c5e39348a82",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67d898db58bd816f38d04d33",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "麦昆的异常",
      "source_fingerprint": "7571cef09188c39b1c5616e9be71eb9c8be1e4acbb3c040f3020b06b89a05d88",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ead6ba52cea77dc3d8bf9f41",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白赖恩为了“皋月赏”，\n不停训练直到深夜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1923ffd617d060ff98fd756429460990a95f370764bf962b7fd73cbfcf987a91",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48eea7e4de077f5a65e35bd4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "某一天，\n她遇见了同样练习到很晚的艾尼斯风神。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b73a6da5125b58f86c4840a5473feadb6f0d1a9b7f00f81b093fa2fbb85e97fd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f97e686d965999e3789f6e8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "艾尼斯风神宣告在下次比赛，\n她一定会让心里只有目白麦昆的\n目白赖恩看向自己。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f001a5e5255550cceb4664ae59ced950dbcc1a02f940380d3a91ce31b8edea07",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027402.json",
