    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:152a413804c635b8cd5e22e5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而目白赖恩对于\n将和好友竞争的这件事感到不安。",
      "source_fingerprint": "28e0308c8ced61e73714e34aee652fbab5ea0790c8dbc0da43b4652ff14ca890",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d41de0998a1e57c9bb38487",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在春季的中山抓住我吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "afe87a22c89cd393e5a384de4ec845a61cae8594a648986fbda4d52afece7d69",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36aeb71a51e5eca84de0ddc2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "达成参加经典赛的目标后……\n目白赖恩在接下来的几天\n陷入了燃烧殆尽症候群。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc167db3041d57a23fa5852ec9c3363975b5f222c789a5ec6b406b5cd19cae18",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc1b44474bc828b56698f316",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "与失去干劲的她相反，\n孑然一身地踏入比赛世界的艾尼斯风神──",
      "source_fingerprint": "2aedcd121038a93fd46a44b2fe6d5e5725d77d256ae9d6c2347d8a8bd2b17809",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a71aef5e2febbeb922508c28",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她表示自己是为了家人而“认真”奔跑，\n并且向目白赖恩传达自己对比赛的热情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b87d078a86a01d75bfe3d47df982c40375108f88305696655a1a8a7ed22fe70",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d48bb7a03cd0682a8ef1805",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白赖恩听完她的话之后，再次鼓起干劲，\n下定决心参加“日本德比”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "174085af085a5dd1431ea739ba3a1a8e7f0c720a43b1e91841a2b1b10786a37c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9af319d9b5b93173ec5b5eb4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使是不起眼的我……",
      "source_fingerprint": "04f5904d274de79b68ca966d43822da9fe042faeba141a532052b66fbd8f4f9a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97ff559a02272079d9eca718",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白麦昆表示自己将参加“菊花赏”。\n目白赖恩认为自己没有一点能赢过她，\n而失去了自信。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fea202ed9e2b46959e717033aad860548828824fc040b04e10226d2c0ba64790",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8edf81625429811a030f8964",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "面对沮丧的目白赖恩，\n训练员表示历经重重训练的肌肉\n就是她的最佳武器。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43d50f169da171a9a0dfc984283ba7fda41d92d0fd7e17112144710c5c63281e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27d1cc3d55eadfafcd0234aa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "原本半信半疑的目白麦昆\n在见识到目白赖恩紧实的肌肉后，\n确信那就是目白赖恩可靠的武器。",
      "source_fingerprint": "94de3a1dbbb5d3e48281fb5718ce7f956c067ebf74ebe1c607f91b2dc65ee5a2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b614dab408f06ef68357fce",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白家成员将展开激烈对决的“菊花赏”，\n已经近在眼前。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed64bc434f3acfa0693b1bde4ba90e6ce659642895887af3fb535b36c8c7df61",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46f64ef6c9d6ea7ae6217494",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "劲敌猛追在后",
      "source_fingerprint": "96431cb931c5911155693f074123708902292ae0807d5431bfc9daf9478caf3a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3d35f5e00765f3e0ccc8212",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在即将迎向春季GⅠ战线的某个晚上。\n目白赖恩对接下来的目标感到既迷惘又苦恼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2091995e17da64950c6c22b7485b6c11e6c89241e7370dc12de668bf7e0e690",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce0dcc085705382e2a5e758f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员仔细听完她的想法后，\n巧妙地引导她去发现内心真正的愿望。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e6f203b24927cf39a5d33c381c33015798e7d09c0714f096fa191c5c78ec278",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a0218b968c0639789392b12",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白赖恩诚实面对自己的内心后，\n终于察觉自己想成为\n像目白麦昆她们那样的“巨星赛马娘”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "865bfc8f1b02b6b2f836821b71804dc5b53f1ed90d2c6f955634af86f8a54323",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f0fab59207c8080ce1763d5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "纵使目白赖恩的内心还不成熟，\n她依然背负着那份脆弱，\n奔向严苛的春季赛事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d0fd98158ce3eb9c439fc73a18a7b66e5b3c26afc52337a912d0639f41e7372",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a4e67b6e02a8f0fd4f60246",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "通往巨星的道路",
      "source_fingerprint": "755669b46592fa15b3997d502b9105b2b93f896b61d042bbb16d882568fee999",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8985cba1f10a15faa2904c00",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白赖恩彻底成了人气王。\n她周围的环境也确实逐渐改变。",
      "source_fingerprint": "61167eaf0e9bfd3b2f077c72b8f93442712a7c739f562afdfa741ed766b31538",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:697eac5ea2144b42a4c35629",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了报答粉丝们的支持，\n她宣告自己要拿下\n“宝冢纪念”和“有马纪念”的胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e85bce6704bfc0073a0cfdb28aaa2c9fae2c1099dc7c1872e869f5888bc33070",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:923e11ac3564e378879a5f1c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "首先是“宝冢纪念”。\n她与目白麦昆的第三次对决，\n眼看就要到来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "809717c5243c412e8ed35b08c49a12a144e06afd830968b05790860cc703a680",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5205c747b00a606df588571",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一步步的努力",
      "source_fingerprint": "23a6c41c9dca6fe71ae64e0b660303a9b4f7eeedc21ee353d10067550e7ea703",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f5ce41ccd195b6c9a79e8e3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对还在成长的赛马娘来说，\n有机会让实力大幅提升的\n“夏季集训”的时期到来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4842e517d6bf7f98ee8a1f480e1bc47af1f7b36d0e715f7e055dd60481c0ae2e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77b953ab86f2aac77c43447f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过“夏季集训”这个情境，\n让目白赖恩变得有些奇怪。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92b6306495dc5dac31fbb98b46519c0391fb68b448da9823ec2e8c1baacf8d4a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4f2a98ea3ff6ff7c85f224f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "总之，参加这个活动也是为了\n让经历数场激战的她好好放松。\n“夏季集训”就这样拉开了序幕。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d9ef1bc05b5f41854f8436dc5c80fec73742c7afd5a946f091c174682c52b9f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db9f5ced1548e0be90e77f68",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训（第二年）开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e193ad94ba56712a8e92ed87a15587d1a6af48670f61e354efcb818a0837f0c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e6ca118e4b29f756cd0d7b1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "到了夏季集训的季节。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c2c60cb035748239e34c1bbbfc6b27e46c024203d98c91699c23c82cec26821",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6fc19e8cb663596573ec84ec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了像目白麦昆说的那样，\n成为独当一面的淑女──",
      "source_fingerprint": "d356798a2f6fa3682f9fee16e0f77bf408729fe43f7f510ecb964560956d12b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af28400c383b16dbb711145a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白赖恩打算在这个夏天让内心有所成长。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f877060a4517e53c013d3706e381dcbdc1c1d8e3b865c27b46e8867b16d0d18e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
