    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b28f742846d4fdcccfdf13b1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“出道战”当天。\n内心雀跃不已的目白赖恩说\n要让经过重重锻炼的肌肉发出怒吼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00f25813edbbf1f6336f467f24477a0bcc7965678e7491d7cc77feb5c7a6380e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cba32a42c7659af62177859",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而她立刻想到\n其他赛马娘也是怀着梦想或期待迎向出道战，\n因此心情低落。",
      "source_fingerprint": "828f1bf2c8c6e664ee5dd47a29dd38a6d65e356e23568c342bed7e63c24c7f50",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b47ac01db1524b8ad0f6a6b9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看不下去的艾尼斯风神于是开口激励她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "262406d2092fc8dbd05f4b421989c49ff5cc17e2f119658b2430667c3992651a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:403ac197d52072ebd837e882",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白赖恩发现也有人支持着自己后，\n总算顺利振作起来，重新面对比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb9b8bc907336c4966578f5d6981041b2c1c63449c776bd7d6c088255681f55f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e584cdc4bffa7d7bf8c2bfa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向出道战",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ea754365577b70c3247fb413fa7b90388e1e4a185a1da5f6c50ef25fe13c496",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74f85daa33125cc00b936e6c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“新马级杯”比赛当天。\n为了参加憧憬的经典赛，\n目白赖恩必须好好表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6d247c4e5564b3375056ec50504f315783276ae57f7e791c7ad0f4753cae0b6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39b961d602db09d4055d52ab",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白赖恩鼓起干劲、舍弃天真的想法后，\n信步走向赛道。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9445eb2d336b8c1ac5ec470961af96c5e014c6bde843f9bbbf35f2d9488adfd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b845476442cc840e8909e20",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向新马级杯",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3caef18053f692bcdbe0934725e91befe147446b0767840578087a108a57f9d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad5c4c2d9e20f707f1fbd5ba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经典三冠竞赛的第一战──\n“皋月赏”终于要开始了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "60d9eb13446f27f3ca92ec510041759f0d4d3af1117a0dbae01b95beaf656b11",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027411.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73f1399dd0b2d4f3e65fd514",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白赖恩向带领自己\n抵达这里的训练员表达感谢之情后，\n前往赛场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e22c0364f5a14eb97107926defb3e0c1f88f8f72206ed5c7109214631e2299c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027411.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3057a38744bfe8f5a9b35ff4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "紧接着，她将在憧憬的比赛中\n与斗志昂扬的艾尼斯风神展开对决！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aef4ff9ec5e7936ff2d593eaa08b20faaa5b68dadd69cafe528cbf9f887c0d21",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027411.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:060719f9f260bb5c5607b821",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向皋月赏",
      "source_fingerprint": "83ff224a61598a6c666007568d7268968b6f324292cc2eee89e3b5acc428c30a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027411.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd442c8dbd055a8b856fbe31",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一阵静谧的风吹过东京赛场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0f33af23953aad78803e697f9130a57e31bc85926cffdfd7aab9e87a4958eea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a92f26476c55696adf10d682",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "纵使这条赛道很长，\n目白赖恩仍然认为艾尼斯风神能一路领先到底，\n并下定决心要追上她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f688c3a209f3989beddf2f8a9c2966d83d82dc874c445c27f27ecf0483150576",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ab5f552ecf79d90a8d242c2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "另一方面，\n艾尼斯风神也预期目白赖恩一定会追上来，\n于是鼓起干劲要保持第一直到最后。",
      "source_fingerprint": "837774f8757938f81cc36c16dfafc6b3232c0f6e680a555878323b9efa4a5f6a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e360c7d2e59d9bf9fec7eac",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "领先的艾尼斯风神与紧追在后的目白赖恩。\n全力以赴的两人──将在大舞台上正面对决。",
      "source_fingerprint": "341d1aff9d298e1ccec82b026747f4d7ef835695c76d833cb48d5fe15f2a43a6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87207831ae16ae0554361b84",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向日本德比",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4074326c9093437fbf37c8e5b00d67df67963c2eed1109506df4b11f06953bc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bda13eaa7e124a88b8ee225",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "到了“菊花赏”的比赛当天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7d9a0a283ae09b5bbd66af229360ca2122880a4f1c87768509532a63b90958c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f484b078710864b350a68563",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白赖恩虽然已经输过目白麦昆无数次，\n不过这正是她不停追逐目白麦昆，\n并且变得如此强大的原因。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2b291258596f02f1ec032421b4740ae51eaad8bfd5994fe30077d117b29d4d1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17b522cecc4ec3adbbdff44f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而目白麦昆也对开始展现出\n个人风格的目白赖恩宣告自己将全力取胜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b139de93ec3554e367a8852558c94aa315474d11ff5b96e00093c6641a2e5cd7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc285ef9961a76393afdd716",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "接着──\n燃起斗志的两人一起前往一决胜负的战场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "866cfe3f47cb262fc9aae8a6932e83dd67bc2171fc87ceb7975e223095025a53",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1027/storytimeline_501027413.json",
